  works. Come on in\, grab a name tag at the bar area\, find the tables tha
 t are reserved for the Meetup group.**\n\n**The $2.50 fee can be paid to t
 he venue by talking to any of the bartenders. Please support our host venu
 e and purchase food and drink.**
